This will help with unit testing ArrayList and you can add as many test methods as you like to ensure that your ArrayList class behaves as expected.
Note that PexFramework is capable of testing a range of static methods and complex nested methods. It automatically generates multiple test scenarios for each method to ensure every possible branch is covered. 

